<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσποι-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		Demarat. ap. <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.309d
		</span></i>, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσποίητος</span></b> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taken to oneself, assumed, affected, pretended</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐραστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					222a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					58.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. καλοκἀγαθία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Din.
					3.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλανθρωπία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>VV</u>
					1251b3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυγή</span> Demarat. l.c.
				Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ητῶς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήτως</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ
			ὄντι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				174d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.47
			</span></i>, etc.: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσποιητά</span>
			as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				103.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				106.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be adopted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				1.57
			</span></i>.</div>
